{
  "sans": [
    {
      "text": "* i've been thinking\n  about selling treats\n  too.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    }
  ],
  "offers": [
    {
      "text": "* want some fried snow?\n* it's just 5G.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* did i say 5G?\n* i meant 50G.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* really?\n* how about 5000G?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* 50000G.\n* that's my final offer.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    }
  ],
  "no": [
    [
      {
        "text": "* you're right.",
        "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
        "font": "fnt_comicsans"
      },
      {
        "text": "* i should charge way\n  more than that.",
        "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
        "font": "fnt_comicsans"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "* you're right.",
        "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
        "font": "fnt_comicsans"
      },
      {
        "text": "* that's still too low.",
        "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
        "font": "fnt_comicsans"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "* i have to pay for\n  the raw materials\n  somehow.",
        "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
        "font": "fnt_comicsans"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "* don't you know a\n  good deal when you\n  hear one?",
        "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
        "font": "fnt_comicsans"
      }
    ]
  ],
  "poor": [
    {
      "text": "* what?\n* you don't have the\n  money?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* hey, that's okay.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* i don't have any snow.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanschuckle",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    }
  ],
  "rich": [
    {
      "text": "* wow, that's a lot\n  of cash.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* that's why i'm sorry\n  to say...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sansblink",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* i can't sell you\n  this fried snow.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sansblink",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* it's got too much\n  sentimental value.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanswink",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    }
  ],
  "decahedron": [
    {
      "text": "* (It looks like a snow ball...)",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* (Actually, it's a\n  snowdecahedron.)",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    }
  ],
  "snowball": [
    {
      "text": "* (It's a snow ball.)",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    }
  ],
  "camera": [
    {
      "text": "* ...!?\n* There's a camera hidden inside\n  this lump of snow.",
      "portrait": null,
